  "world": "qra1",
  "source": "DHM Quran Recitation (QRA1) · lesson 10. From Dr. Hassan's course; every word in his voice, every verse by Sheikh Al-Minshawi.",
  "title": {
    "ar": "الشَّدَّةُ مَعَ الْفَتْحَةِ",
    "en": "Shaddah with fatha"
  },
  "topic": "Read shaddah with fatha and recite Surat Al-Ma'un",
  "minutes": 15,
  "learn": [
    {
      "en": "A letter with shaddah and fatha is said twice: first with sukoon, then with fatha.",
      "title": "Shaddah with fatha"
    },
    {
      "en": "Now we read the name of the surah.",
      "title": "The surah",
      "ar": "سُورَةُ الْمَاعُونِ",
      "aud": "c-1-ar",
      "tr": "soorato almaa'oone"
    },
    {
      "en": "Listen to Sheikh Al-Minshawi recite Surat Al-Ma'un. Follow with your finger, then recite it yourself.",
      "title": "Surat Al-Ma'un",
      "ar": "بِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ أَرَءَيْتَ ٱلَّذِى يُكَذِّبُ بِٱلدِّينِ ﴿١﴾ فَذَٰلِكَ ٱلَّذِى يَدُعُّ ٱلْيَتِيمَ ﴿٢﴾ وَلَا يَحُضُّ عَلَىٰ طَعَامِ ٱلْمِسْكِينِ ﴿٣﴾ فَوَيْلٌۭ لِّلْمُصَلِّينَ ﴿٤﴾ ٱلَّذِينَ هُمْ عَن صَلَاتِهِمْ سَاهُونَ ﴿٥﴾ ٱلَّذِينَ هُمْ يُرَآءُونَ ﴿٦﴾ وَيَمْنَعُونَ ٱلْمَاعُونَ ﴿٧﴾",
      "aud": "c-2-ar"
    },
    {
      "en": "At the end of any gathering, the Prophet ﷺ advised us to say this du'aa: Glory is to You, O Allah, and praise. We bear witness that none has the right to be worshiped except You. We seek Your forgiveness and we turn to You in repentance.",
      "title": "At the end of our lesson",
      "ar": "سُبْحَانَكَ اللَّهُمَّ وَبِحَمْدِكَ، نَشْهَدُ أَنْ لَا إِلَهَ إِلَّا أَنْتَ، نَسْتَغْفِرُكَ وَنَتُوبُ إِلَيْكَ",
      "aud": "c-3-ar",
      "tr": "Subhanaka Allahumma wa bihamdika, nashhadu an la ilaha illa anta, nastaghfiruka wa natubu ilayk"
    }
  ],
